# Keep the build context and image small: the worker only needs the Go
# sources and the aviation data that db.InitDB reads from resources/. The
# pairs to fetch are decided locally from the flight data, so it needs none of
# that, nor the models, videomaps, scenarios, or bundled weather that the vice
# client uses.
.git
whisper.cpp
sherpa-onnx
resources/models
resources/scenarios
resources/traffic
resources/videomaps
resources/wx
vice
*.prof
*.pprof
